IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc6-builders`
IMPORT `ccc6-csaem`
IMPORT `ccc6-tests-support`

-- Tests for s 163.1. Expected values decided from the text before each run.
-- The eight facts of the definition, in order: a visual representation; written material; an audio recording; (a)(i) shows a person who is or is depicted as under 18 in explicit sexual activity;
-- (a)(ii) a dominant characteristic is the depiction, for a sexual purpose, of a sexual organ of a person under 18; (b) advocates or counsels an offence; (c) written material's dominant characteristic is describing, for a sexual purpose, an offence;
-- (d) an audio recording's dominant characteristic is describing, presenting or representing, for a sexual purpose, an offence.

`s 163.1 test s 787(1) penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine in the discretion of the court`, `no fine is stated`

§ `s 163.1(1) the definition`
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a)(i)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (a) needs a visual representation
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a visual representation that is neither (i) nor (ii) and does not advocate
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b): written material that advocates or counsels
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b): an audio recording
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b): a visual representation
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (c) is for written material only
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (d)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (d) is for an audio recording only
#ASSERT `s 163.1(1) child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means": anything else is outside

§ `s 163.1(2) Making`
-- (what the person did, the answer of s 163.1(1))
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) makes` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) prints` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) publishes` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) possesses for the purpose of publication` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) none of those` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) makes` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not such material
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the conduct is the offence of making, printing or publishing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(2) makes` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the punishment` EQUALS `ss 150 to 182 test an indictable punishment` (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 14) (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 1)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(2) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`

