#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the conduct is the offence of distributing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(3) sells` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the conduct is the offence of distributing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(3) advertises` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the conduct is the offence of distributing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(3) imports` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the conduct is the offence of distributing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` `s 163.1(3) exports` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
