#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the punishment` EQUALS `ss 150 to 182 test an indictable punishment` (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 14) (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 1)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(3) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`

§ `s 163.1(4) Possession`
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4) the conduct is the offence of possessing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4) the conduct is the offence of possessing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4) the conduct is the offence of possessing child sexual abuse and exploitation material` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4)(a) the punishment on indictment` EQUALS `ss 150 to 182 test an indictable punishment` (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 10) (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of years` 1)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` EQUALS `ss 150 to 182 test a summary punishment` `ss 150 to 182 test a term of two years less a day` (`ss 150 to 182 test a term of months` 6)
#ASSERT `s 163.1(4) the class of the offence` EQUALS `ss 150 to 182 test both`

